- Tagline line: primary professional identity (e.g., TECHNICAL OPERATIONS & PROCESS IMPROVEMENT | AI-ENABLED WORKFLOWS)
- Contact info on one line: City, ST | phone | email | linkedin | github
- ## for section headers (## PROFESSIONAL SUMMARY)
- ### Role | Company for each job, then *location | dates* on the next line
- - for bullet points, one per line, no blank lines between bullets
- **bold** for skill category labels (e.g., **Support & Collaboration:**)
- One blank line between sections, none between a header and its content
- Keep the entire resume to content that fits on 2 pages. Prioritize the most relevant experience; condense older or less relevant roles to fewer bullets.

